  "solution": "**BODMAS Table:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7751840ca1840d12cadc428f84d30e2cdcd5e7f82d52a57de21f2404c58eed88.png] \n\n**Given Equation: **59 * 11 * 11 * 48 * 1 * 12 \n\nLet's check each option one by one:\n\nOption 1) –, ÷, +, ×, =\n\n 59 * 11 * 11 * 48 * 1 * 12 \n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n59 - __**11 ÷ 11**__ + 48 × 1 = 12 \n\n59 - 1 + __**48 × 1**__ = 12\n\n__**59 **__- 1 __**+ 48**__ = 12 \n\n__**107 - 1**__ = 12\n\n106 ≠ 12. \n\nOption 2) –, +, ÷, ×, =\n\n59 * 11 * 11 * 48 * 1 * 12 \n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n59 - 11 + __**11 ÷ 48**__ × 1 = 12 \n\n59 - 11 + __**0.2 × 1**__ = 12\n\n__**59**__ - 11 __**+ 0.2**__ = 12\n\n__**59.2 - 11**__ = 12\n\n48.2 ≠ 12.\n\n**Option 3) +, ÷, –, ×, =**\n\n59 * 11 * 11 * 48 * 1 * 12 \n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n59 + __**11 ÷ 11 **__- 48 × 1 = 12 \n\n59 + 1 - __**48 × 1**__ = 12\n\n__**59 + 1**__ - 48 = 12\n\n__**60 - 48**__ = 12\n\n__**12 = 12.**__ \n\nOption 4) ×, –, +, ÷, =\n\n59 * 11 * 11 * 48 * 1 * 12 \n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n59 × 11 - 11 + __**48 ÷ 1**__ = 12 \n\n__**59 ×**____** 11**__ - 11 + 48 = 12 \n\n__**649**__ - 11 __**+ 48**__ = 12\n\n697 - 11 = 12\n\n686 ≠ 12.\n\nHence, the correct answer is ***'Option 3'.***",
